<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps upgrades American Life Holding debt.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps upgrades American Life Holding debt.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said it upgraded the senior subordinated debt rating of American Life Holding Corp to Triple B Minus from Double B Minus.</p>
<p>The action follows completion Wednesday of the purchase of American Life's parent, American Life Holding Inc, by Conseco Inc.</p>
<p>Duff said it is placing the Triple B Minus debt rating on rating watch-developing to be consistent with other Conseco-related debt ratings.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
